KORTEX PAST EXAMINATION PAPERS
WAEC - Physics (Year 2023)

Q1. A body of mass 5 kg is accelerated uniformly from rest to 20 m/s in 4 seconds. Calculate work done.
  (A) 500 J
  (B) 1000 J
  (C) 1500 J
  (D) 2000 J
  Answer: B - Work done = 0.5 * m * v^2 = 0.5 * 5 * 400 = 1000 Joules.


